      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        74.86609649658203,
        434.0320129394531,
        503.35491943359375,
        445.9389953613281
      ],
      "text": "Moderate We are moderately confident in the effect estimate: the true effect is likely",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        225.10240173339844,
        443.83453369140625,
        499.04571533203125,
        455.6515197753906
      ],
      "text": "to be close to the estimate of the effect, but there is a possibility that it is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        225.10240173339844,
        453.5470275878906,
        306.299560546875,
        465.364013671875
      ],
      "text": "substantially different.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        74.86609649658203,
        477.0171203613281,
        489.7568054199219,
        488.9241027832031
      ],
      "text": "Low Our confidence in the effect estimate is limited: the true effect may be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        225.10240173339844,
        486.8196105957031,
        422.5086975097656,
        498.6365966796875
      ],
      "text": "substantially different from the estimate of the effect.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        74.86609649658203,
        510.2897644042969,
        517.0366821289062,
        522.19677734375
      ],
      "text": "Very low We have very little confidence in the effect estimate: the true effect is likely to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        225.10240173339844,
        520.0922241210938,
        422.5257873535156,
        531.9092407226562
      ],
      "text": "be substantially different from the estimate of effect.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4244995117188,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "A recommendation may be strong or conditional (see Table A1.2), reflecting the degree to which the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.4178466796875,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "GDG is confident in the balance between desirable and undesirable consequences of implementing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.442138671875,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "the recommendation. The strength of a recommendation is primarily determined by four main",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4243774414062,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "factors, namely: the confidence in the estimates of effect of the evidence (that is, the quality of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.43994140625,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "the evidence as assessed through GRADE); the values and preferences related to the outcomes of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.4188842773438,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "an intervention or exposure; the balance of benefits and harms; and resource implications. Other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.4387817382812,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "considerations that may affect the strength of a recommendation include priority of the problem,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
